		{"name":"ssinfbullstring","arg":{"format":"{}{}{}","snippet":"ssinfbullstring{${1:x}}{${2:y}}{${3:n}}"},"doc":"\\ssinfbullstring{x}{y}{n} is a shortcut for \\ssdrop{\\bullet} followed by n−1 copies of \\ssline{x}{y} \\ssdrop{\\bullet}, followed by \\ssarrow[void]{x}{y}."},
